# VPN (Virtual Private Network)

## What is VPN?
- Creates encrypted tunnel between user and VPN server through internet

### Main Functions
1. Encrypt traffic
2. Hide public IP

### Normal Flow (Without VPN)
User → ISP → Internet

### VPN Flow
User  
→ Encrypted Tunnel  
→ VPN Server  
→ Internet

### What Others Can See
#### Cafe/ISP can see:
- VPN server IP
- Encrypted traffic
- Traffic amount/timing

#### Cafe/ISP cannot easily see:
- Real content
- Passwords
- Messages
- Actual websites inside tunnel

### Benefits
- Privacy
- Safe public WiFi usage
- Secure remote work
- Bypass restrictions

### Important
- VPN does NOT make user fully anonymous
- VPN provider itself can still observe traffic

### HTTPS vs VPN
- HTTPS encrypts one website connection
- VPN encrypts ALL network traffic

### OSI Layer Relation
- Encryption → Layer 6 (Presentation)
- Tunneling/routing → Layer 3 (Network)

